Features

- Three-tier architecture implementation.
- Secure network design using public and private subnets.
- Traffic distribution using Application Load Balancer.
- Automatic scaling using EC2 Auto Scaling Groups.
- Managed relational database using Amazon RDS.
- Network access control using Security Groups.
- Infrastructure provisioning using Terraform.
- Monitoring and resource management using CloudWatch.

Architecture Workflow

User Request → Application Load Balancer → EC2 Application Servers → Amazon RDS Database.

